    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116382" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡροσκοπ-έω</span></b> , Astrol., of a zodiacal sign or
		part of one, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mark by its
				rising the time</i> of birth, <i>to be in the ascendant,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν χρόνον τοῦ ἀνίσχοντος ζῳδίου καὶ
					κατ᾽ ἀκρίβειαν -οῦντος λαμβάνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					5.70
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				33
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ὡροσκοπούσης μοίρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				2.8.42
			</span></i>.</div>
